376
00:24:31,513 --> 00:24:33,432
Sentarnos a almorzar. Saldrá el sol.

377
00:24:35,058 --> 00:24:36,476
Truenos y centellas.

378
00:24:37,728 --> 00:24:39,605
Para cuando terminas, el sol volvió.

379
00:24:41,064 --> 00:24:42,399
Porque las tormentas pasan.

380
00:24:50,782 --> 00:24:52,035
MAX CADY EXONERADO

381
